<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτωθεν</span></b> , rarely <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω-θε</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Eub.
			16
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Alex.
			128.3
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			4.44
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω</span>):— Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from below, up from below</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					697
				</span></i>
			 (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπέμπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					382
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανιέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					22e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς γῆς κάτωθεν ἀνίεται ὁ πλοῦτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					403a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. ἄνω πληγὴ ἀνατπωμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					221b
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>from the low country, from the coast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>below, beneath</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					408d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. ἰσχυρότατ᾽ εἶναι δεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. νόμος</span> the law
				<i>below</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				23.28
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Did.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. νόμος; τίς οἶδεν εἰ
					κ. εὐαγῆ τάδε</span>
			; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				521
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κ. θεοί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1070
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				424
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς εἰς τὸ κ.</span> those
				<i>belonging to the next generation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				18d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Logic, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>.g, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>AP</u>
				0.96b37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Top.</u>
				144a29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> as Prep. c.
			gen., <i>below</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῦ ὀμφαλοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aff.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἄκρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
